        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn RH1BQ, Rough Iron H Style Cabinet Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 3\" \"H\" Cabinet Hinge is mounted flush, with no mortising making it easy to install with just a few screws. The rough iron finish duplicates that found on the ironwork of many old European castles and cathedrals by imitating the texture of naturally weathered iron. It has a lifetime no rust warranty.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis hinge is for use where the Door face sits Flush with the door frame. Also available matching <a href=\"/products/3-inch-offset-cabinet-hinge-pair-acorn-rh2bq\"><b>3\" Offset Cabinet Hinge Pair</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Rough Iron 3\" H-Style Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Rough Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Early American Styling</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Priced and sold as a pair (2-hinges)</i>\r\n</p>",
